Z||000002||banditbalz||08-07-2001||11:45 PM||||another member here...<BR>The Mapleview cruise night (Burlington Ont.)closes the gates after the first 500 cars show up. Usually many are left outside scratching their heads. It is the largest weekly outdoor carshow in North America. Dozens of Fieros from Northstars to s/c 3.8 show up every week. If you live in the Toronto area, give this show a try!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ColdOne_1.jpg"> <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||14
